### Web平台管理系统 API 测试脚本
### 启动后端后，可以用这些请求测试API

### 商品相关API

# 获取商品列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=10

# 获取热销商品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/stats/hot-selling?limit=10

# 获取滞销商品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/stats/unsold?limit=10

# 获取毛利率分析
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/stats/gross-margin

### 设备相关API

# 获取设备列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices?page=0&size=10

# 获取单机产出统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/stats/single-output?limit=10

# 获取故障率统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/stats/fault-rate

# 获取运维成本分析
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/stats/maintenance-cost

### 用户相关API

# 获取用户列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?page=0&size=10

# 获取活跃用户统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/stats/active?days=7

# 获取复购率统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/stats/repurchase-rate

# 获取新用户增长趋势
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/stats/growth-trend

# 获取购买时段热力图
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/stats/purchase-heatmap?days=7

### 数据大屏API

# 获取大屏综合数据
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard

### 测试创建商品
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试商品",
  "category": "电子产品",
  "costPrice": 100.00,
  "salePrice": 150.00,
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "salesQuantity": 0,
  "status": "active"
}

### 测试创建设备
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceCode": "DEV9999",
  "name": "测试设备",
  "type": "生产设备",
  "location": "A车间",
  "status": "running",
  "totalRuntime": 1000.0,
  "totalOutput": 10000,
  "faultCount": 0,
  "maintenanceCost": 0.00
}

### 测试创建用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "status": "active",
  "purchaseCount": 0
}
